body:
**P3c is up: #2467** — the final P3 slice (`/ai` = the ChatDock maximized; Studio copilot → the shared right dock with the Interfaces properties folding into center tabs; Live-Canvas auto-maximize in the rail). All behind the default-off `features.chatDock` flag, with an ADR-0054 browser proof on the local rig covering (a) rail ⇄ `/ai` same-thread round-trip, (b) the Studio `[nav] [canvas+properties tabs] [chat]` grid incl. dock collapse/launcher/maximize, and (c) flag-off pixel-parity.

With P3a (#2464) + P3b (#2465) + P3c merged, **every P3 deliverable in the plan above is implemented**. Remaining before this epic can close:

1. Roll the flag out (server-side `features.chatDock: true`) and let it soak;
2. The cleanup PR the plan calls for once P3c proves out: remove the flag + the now-dead console floating-overlay path (the runtime SDUI bubble stays, per ADR §4);
3. Flip the ADR Status line from "shipped behind flag" to done at that point.

Proposal: keep this epic open to track (1)–(3), or close it now and track the cleanup as its own issue — maintainer's call.
